I have Parallel Scan Algorithm: Hillis & Steele (1986) and I want to execute inner for loop parallel. Error   C3015   initialization in OpenMP 'for' statement has improper form  OpenMP  c:\users\matja\documents\visual studio 2015\projects\psseminar\openmp\main.c I never experienced this error before, I have googled around but found nothing useful. Includes: #include <omp.h>
