} PS D:\MyScript> C:\Users\Xeni\source\repos\matmul\x64\Release\matmul.exe
mat(16, 9) * mat(9, 24): 5.200116 microseconds
mat(128, 256) * mat(256, 512): 30128.739453 microseconds
